WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.400
Hello everyone, and welcome back to the channel.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.800
Today we are building a small browser extension.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.200
It reads the subtitles from the current page.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Then it translates every line into Chinese.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.000
Everything runs locally, inside your browser.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.400
No cloud API, and no token costs at all.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.800
The model is cached, so it also works offline.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.200
Press the space bar to open the bilingual popup.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.600
The popup always keeps the last five lines.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:34.000
Thanks for watching, and see you next time.